Postiz
------

ClipStitchr incorporates selected source code from Postiz, a social media
scheduling application.

Upstream project: https://github.com/gitroomhq/postiz-app
Audited source revision: cf4c432c00c9db775ea1b1f12480a8e2b89aec32
Import date: 2026-08-02
